        <div class="sb__content">
          <h3 class="sb__title t-h-4xs" data-lg-reveal="heading">Python</h3>
          <p class="sb__text" data-lg-reveal="text">
            Dive into the world of programming with Python, the language of the
            future.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__illus sb__illus--python">
          <div
            class="sb__illus__lottie"
            data-lg-lottie="/assets/lottie/usp-python.json"
            data-lg-lottie-autoplay
            data-lg-lottie-loop
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="s__usp sb-usp">
        <div class="sb__content">
          <h3 class="sb__title t-h-4xs" data-lg-reveal="heading">SQL</h3>
          <p class="sb__text" data-lg-reveal="text">
            “I don’t know SQL but I work in data” is a famous quote by no one,
            ever. Your SQL skills are indispensable when working in data.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__illus sb__illus--sql">
          <div
            class="sb__illus__lottie"
            data-lg-lottie="/assets/lottie/usp-sql.json"
            data-lg-lottie-autoplay
            data-lg-lottie-loop
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="s__usp sb-usp">
        <div class="sb__content">
          <h3 class="sb__title t-h-4xs" data-lg-reveal="heading">
            Machine Learning
          </h3>
          <p class="sb__text" data-lg-reveal="text">
            The sub-domain of Artificial Intelligence where all the cool stuff
            is happening. Learn how to build your own end-to-end ML pipelines.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__illus sb__illus--machine-learning">
          <div
