      <div class="s__usp sb-usp">
        <div class="sb__content">
          <h3 class="sb__title t-h-4xs" data-lg-reveal="heading">
            Data Analytics
          </h3>
          <p class="sb__text" data-lg-reveal="text">
            Data drives innovation and is collected at every ad you click, every
            feed you scroll and every purchase you make – which means it’s never
            been more crucial to know how to analyze it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__illus sb__illus--analytics">
          <div
            class="sb__illus__lottie"
